<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Pricing Plans</title>
    <style>
 /* Page styling */
body {
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
background-color: #f4f6f8;
padding: 30px;
}

h1 {
text-align: center;
color: #333;
}

/* Pricing container */
.pricing-container {
display: flex;
flex-wrap: wrap;
gap: 20px;
justify-content: center;
}

/* Pricing cards */
.pricing-card {
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
justify-content: space-between;
flex: 0 0 200px;
border: 2px solid black;
padding: 20px;
text-align: center;
color: white;
border-radius: 8px;
}

/* Individual plan colors */
.basic-plan {
order: 0;
background-color: #4caf50;
}

.pro-plan {
order: 1;
flex-grow: 2;
background-color: #2196f3;
}

.premium-plan {
order: 2;
background-color: #9c27b0;
}

/* Price text */
.pricing-card p {
font-size: 1.2em;
font-weight: bold;
}

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Pricing Plans</h1>

<div class="pricing-container">
    <div class="pricing-card basic-plan">
        <h2>Basic</h2>
        <p>$9/month</p>
    </div>

```
<div class="pricing-card pro-plan">
    <h2>Pro</h2>
    <p>$19/month</p>
</div>

<div class="pricing-card premium-plan">
    <h2>Premium</h2>
    <p>$29/month</p>
</div>
```

</div>

</body>
</html>
